    "content": "GOVERNMENT ENGINEERING COLLEGE, BARTONHILL OFFERS EIGHT M.TECH DEGREE COURSES:\nThe duration of the M. Tech programme is two years . As per the AICTE norms, the annual intake of PG course is eighteen. Admission to the PG programme is done through the Centralised Admission Process by the Directorate of Technical Education. All the students need to pay the fees only at the Government rate."
