    "content": "Data Capturing Points - DCP Proforma\nB.Tech Regulations 2024\nCivil Engineering scheme\nB.Tech Regulations 2019\nMechanical Engineering scheme\nElectronics and Communication Engineering scheme\nElectrical and Electronics Engineering scheme\nM.Tech Curriculum and Regulations\nB.Tech Curriculum 2024\nEXAMINATION MANUAL\nInformation Technology scheme\nKerala Service Rules I\nKerala Service Rules II\nConstitution of India\n2003 and 2004 special rules\nKerala Civil Services Rules 1960\nGovernment Servants Conduct Rules, 1960\nHand Book of order issued to kerala State and Subordinate Service Rules 1958 (for the Period From 07-12-1991 to 28-02-2011)\nKERALA STATE AND SUBORDINATE SERVICES RULES, 1958\nAICTE (Gender Sensitisation, Prevention and Prohibition of Sexual) Regualtion)2016\nAICTE Degree Pay, Qualifications and Promotions 2019\nAICTE clarifications June 2020\n2010 03 05 aicte gazette notification degree clear\nAICTE Notification 2000\nKFC I -VII Edition\nREVISED STORES PURCHASE MANUAL\nKERALA BUDGET MANUAL\nIndustrial Visit Form\nProperty Statement - Nil\nWi - Fi form\nDuty Leave Application - Student\nEOA FORM FOR SEMESTER & COURSE REGISTRATION\nSemester and Course Registration\nApplication for Railway Season Ticket\nEOA Condonation Form\nMedical Certificate\nApplication for Certificates from College Office\nApplication for Bus Concession"
